# --- Scheduling ---
# The site embeds the GoHighLevel calendar the live site uses
# ("Keisha Smith's Personal Calendar"). Its ID is committed as the default, so
# nothing needs setting here for the calendar to work.
#
# Override only to point at a different calendar. Find the ID in GoHighLevel
# under Calendars -> the calendar -> its share/embed link, which ends in
# /widget/booking/<id>.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_BOOKING_CALENDAR_ID=
